action core.log – Log (category general)
Writes a message to the run log

Fields (with:):
  message  Text to write; may span several lines
           string, required, multi-line, e.g. Import finished
  level    Log level of the message
           string, one of debug|info|warn|error, default info

transform core.log – Log (category output)
Writes records to the run log and passes them on

Fields (with:):
  level   Log level of the messages
          string, one of debug|info|warn|error, default info
  every   Writes every n-th record, e.g. 1000 for large data
          integer, default 1
  fields  Fields to write, in this order; empty: all fields
          list of string
